Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S30|10;|600;!1,B#2$E;R+d4$k;R+7$Hk;R!2+_M!2'a4,:#1!2'dT#1!2'dU!1,00!1,01vdvd!2'dV#2#1!3+_D+7!2'_V!1,_K1!2'd:#32#2!3+_D+7!2'dW#32#2").
